---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro'
const meta = {
  title: 'Nueva Temporada 2024',
  date: '2024-01-05',
  category: 'Temporada',
  image: 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCxyjUk1j3S0mTy_fi1IYkL5kZKHCnUjP0zY-WGujhILhnzK0rCqbmba8acjtc9udwI55hqmJynmz96x0-foeXlRerzVfM-ce7Hz2j_dAVuBfFgq36w11jqQ91osKnCnePiVeudoPMftN2b1YrqpSxKLj2IofAV9x88w-HT0uyafvXfaOjjWrXzrNGCYSjwmPiQ9op98B2uIkaSKo2jU_REJLjbRd6gyU-h0I8qevJCRc5stf4oDbRh58RSZilR22VQ5MlhVHEcsGs'
}
---

<ArticleLayout title={meta.title} description="Anuncio de la temporada">
  <article class="layout-content-container flex flex-col max-w-[960px] w-full flex-1 px-4 lg:px-20 py-10 lg:py-16">
    <div class="flex gap-3 mb-6">
      <div class="flex h-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-full bg-primary/20 pl-3 pr-3">
        <p class="text-black text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide leading-normal">{meta.category}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">{meta.title}</h1>
      <p class="text-[#898361] text-xl lg:text-2xl font-normal leading-relaxed italic">Presentamos el calendario completo para la temporada 2024.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-b border-[#e5e5e0] py-6 mb-10">
      <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
        <div class="bg-center bg-no-repeat aspect-square bg-cover rounded-full h-12 w-12 border border-[#e5e5e0]" style={`background-image: url('${meta.image}')`}></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold">Comunicado Oficial</p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#898361] text-xs">
            <span>{new Date(meta.date).toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>2 min de lectura</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <button class="text-[#898361] hover:text-primary transition-colors">Compartir</button>
        <button class="text-[#898361] hover:text-primary transition-colors">Guardar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full mb-12">
      <div class="w-full bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-cover flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden rounded-lg min-h-[360px] shadow-sm relative" style={`background-image: url('${meta.image}')`}>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/10"></div>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#898361] text-center">Cartel de la nueva temporada.</figcaption>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none font-display">
      <p>
        La temporada 2024 incluirá una selección de conciertos, recitales y actividades educativas pensadas para todos los públicos. Consulta las fechas y consigue tus entradas anticipadas.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-[#e5e5e0]">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#898361] mb-4">Etiquetas</h4>
        <div class="flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-[#f4f4f0] rounded-lg text-[#181711] text-sm hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors" href="#">Temporada</a>
          <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-[#f4f4f0] rounded-lg text-[#181711] text-sm hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors" href="#">Entradas</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</ArticleLayout>
